OL,3,GNEWSAThe Kent village that helped shape
OL,4,AAudrey Hepburn
OL,5,
OL,6,FToday, a blue plaque on a cottage near
OL,7,Fthe King's Arms pub marks the place
OL,8,Fwhere Hepburn lived between 1936 and
OL,9,F1939.
OL,11,F"It really was the starting point for
OL,12,Fthe young Audrey Hepburn that she
OL,13,Fbecame," said Brian Badham, of Elham
OL,14,FHistorical Society.
